WEBVTT

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:57.340
Daichi! Hey! Daichi!

00:01:57.340 --> 00:01:58.840
Pull yourself together, Daichi!

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.180
Daichi!!

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:21.530
The first battle here in the finals has gone to the extreme with a double Stadium Out!

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:25.580
Daichi! You just gotta
hang in there, Daichi!!

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:27.830
--Please, respond!
--Daichi...

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:29.290
Even though...

00:02:29.290 --> 00:02:33.590
...you were tired after all,
you went so far for me...

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:54.270
Thanks, Daichi...

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:15.500
I'm starvin'...

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.090
D-Daichi...!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:20.170
I'm so hungry
I can't even move...

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.970
Daichi Sumeragi, you...

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.720
Yuriy.
Daichi can't go on.

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:31.690
If you're still looking
for a fight, I'll take you on!

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.110
As much as I'd love to...

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.980
I'm not in any condition
to keep going, either.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:43.160
That's--!

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:46.080
Just from the last attack
that Daichi pulled out...

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:49.410
Either way, both of them
are at their limits.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:56.170
U-um... In other words,

00:03:56.170 --> 00:04:01.630
what will the final
ruling on the first battle be?

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:09.560
Allow us to explain
the current situation.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:14.020
We of the tournament committee believe that,
judging from both players' current conditions,

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:20.190
allowing the match to continue through a re-battle would only do further harm.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:22.900
Therefore, the first battle
will be called as a draw.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:25.910
As such, the winning
team of the second battle

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:29.160
will be acknowledged as the official winner of the championships.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.080
So it's all on the
second match, then...

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:39.630
The winner of the battle
between Kai and me...

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:41.670
Will win the championships.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:48.760
T-That's it! The second battle will decide the fate of the championships!

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:52.980
However, this
is a risky decision!

00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:58.320
it would be unfair to make them fight
again after such a hard fought battle!

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:05.610
So both Daichi and Yuriy have
left things up to their partners!

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:08.120
The time has finally come...

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:11.490
I'm sad that we
can't be out there,

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:16.250
but I'm sure Takao and Kai will show us a battle fitting of the final round.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:23.340
Much like Daichi, it's worrying that Kinomiya will be fighting his second match today...

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:28.390
But his opponent, Hiwatari is...

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:31.510
Kai...

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.480
I'm right here!

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:46.990
Kai...!

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:49.820
Oh, my!
What happened here?

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:55.910
Hiwatari has finally made it to the arena, but he looks like traveled across a wasteland to make it here!

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:59.630
Just what could have
happened to him?

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.920
Why do you look like...

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:04.920
And now...

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:06.880
We're even!

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.050
That's...!

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:12.010
A new Dranzer...!

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.220
Is this what he
meant by "even"?

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.480
That's only half of it.

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:24.190
I think Kai went out test his new Dranzer to put himself in the same condition as Takao.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:26.570
W-What?

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:30.820
You couldn't have...!
Sergey! Boris!

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:42.590
I have no need for
handicaps in our match.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.300
Kai...

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.550
Why you...

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.880
This is no
time to show off.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:51.970
Even so, I understand
how he feels.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.100
This battle is special.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:57.680
Kai wants to fight Takao to
the end on even ground.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:00.350
That's the way he
wants to beat him.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:07.820
What a dedication! What intensity!
He's got the soul of a warrior!

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:10.320
How admirable of
you, Kai Hiwatari!

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:14.280
Takao! A real man would make
sure to appreciate that sentiment!

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:16.240
So put some
fighting spirit into it!

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:19.290
I couldn't be happier, Kai!

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:23.250
I can feel your spirit from
all the way over here!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.880
I know how you feel!

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.800
You can bet that I
won't hold back!

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:34.390
I'm going to fight you with all my Beyspirit
infused into Dragoon Galaxy Turbo!

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.350
This is...!

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:46.860
Like it or not, this is the
final championship battle!

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.440
Blader DJ.

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:50.610
Yes...?

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.040
Use it.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.240
A-are you sure?

00:07:55.240 --> 00:08:02.120
Daichi and Yuriy showed much more power in their first battle than we were expecting.

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:09.000
We have no choice but to use this if we intend to keep up with their power.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.630
But sir...!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:11.720
Now, please.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.050
U-understood.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:21.390
We will now reveal our special stadium
prepared for this very moment!

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:26.770
Beyblade tag-battle world championships!
The stage for the final battle...

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:28.480
Is this!!

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:31.860
What is this?

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:32.610
Don't know...

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:40.830
What is this?

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:42.830
Oh! Unbelievable!

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.710
It's freakin' huge!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:57.720
Their stage for the final battle will be
the biggest stadium we've ever had!

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.180
It's the Wasteland Stadium!

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:04.390
Stadium Outs are impossible here
under normal circumstances!

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:08.770
This'll be a battle to the
end in a sprawling wasteland!

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:13.320
Fight to your heart's content in the Wasteland Stadium!

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:16.490
Our chosen warriors!

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:20.660
I like it.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:24.830
So we fight until
one of us drops?

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:26.830
I couldn't ask
for a better arena!

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.210
However...

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.750
A battle where neither one knows what tricks are up their sleeves...

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:35.420
How is this going to escalate?
It's impossible to tell.

00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:37.930
What's got you scared?

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.970
The mountains I lived in
were way bigger than this.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:46.810
I'm jealous he gets to
fight in a place like this!

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:49.370
Takao! Listen up!

00:09:49.370 --> 00:09:54.110
Run wild until you
can't stop! Do it for me!

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.200
You got it, Daichi.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.200
This is where you and I...

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.370
No!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.580
Rei and Max...

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.040
F-Sangre and Barthez Soldat!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.830
A lot's happened.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:10.040
It's a summary of the
world championships!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:15.630
I'm going to fight a
battle I'll never regret!

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:17.970
You won't regret?

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:25.600
Beyblade tag-battle
world championships!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.480
The final battle!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.860
What is this?

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:35.780
Kai, what in the world
were you up to?

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:39.160
Three! Two! One!

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:41.450
Go, Shoot!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:45.040
Go, Dranzer Gigus Turbo!

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.210
What is this?

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:57.970
Look out!

00:10:58.330 --> 00:11:04.640
Kinomiya hung in there, but lose your balance and it's a one way ticket into the Beystadium!

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:08.720
But to see a shockwave like
this from the first attack...

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:10.200
What about their Beys?

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:17.170
Dragoon and Dranzer are looking for the right chance to attack.

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:24.360
With more space to speed up, their
attacks will be even more powerful!

00:11:24.360 --> 00:11:25.320
Takao...

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:26.580
Kai...

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:32.820
Do your worst, Kinomiya!

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:34.450
Here I come, Kai!

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.100
Whoa!

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:55.250
If they keep this up, the arena
itself is going to be destroyed!

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:00.050
I never thought
they'd be so powerful...

00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:08.130
What speed!
What pure destructive force!

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:11.770
What's going to
happen next in this battle?!

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:14.130
Go!!

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:18.240
I will not lose!

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:31.980
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:46.640
That's it!

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:52.140
Just...

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:55.530
How far are they going to
go in this fierce battle?

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:08.720
Kai's taken a
bit of damage.

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:12.040
So while we've both still
got stamina left...

00:13:12.040 --> 00:13:13.890
Bring it, Kai!

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:19.740
Whoa! Is Dragoon about to
unleash its special move?

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:23.340
Go! Dragoon Galaxy Turbo!

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:26.300
Oh, no you don't!

00:13:36.780 --> 00:13:37.700
What?!

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:50.450
Good idea, Kai.

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:54.940
But I'm just gonna ram right
through your rock wall!

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.600
Now it's my turn.

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:03.920
Here I go!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.090
Darn it!

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:11.450
Uh-oh! Dragoon's defenseless
and gets hit hard!

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:13.950
Is this the end?

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:16.240
Takao!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:17.580
Look out!

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.470
No, Takao!

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:34.730
Oh no!
What an accident!

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:37.090
Kinomiya has fallen
into the stadium!

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:39.570
Is he okay?

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:53.730
Takao!

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:55.580
Are you okay?

00:14:56.280 --> 00:15:01.330
Dragoon's still spinning, so
there's no way I'm going down!

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:03.960
Our battle's still on!

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:07.960
You're going to regret
getting right back up.

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:10.370
Go, Dranzer!

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:13.680
What?!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.880
No way!

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:19.360
Whoa! Hiwatari's going
in for the kill!

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:22.450
Kinomiya's still hurt!
What's his game plan?

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:25.770
Takao, do something!

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:27.260
You better not lose!

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:28.340
Daichi!

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:34.520
That's right! I've got Daichi's and
everyone else's hopes riding on me!

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:37.040
So I can't lose this easily!

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.650
Dragoon!

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:56.290
That's...!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:00.170
That's the--

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:03.400
The tornado wall
Daichi used once!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:16.130
Kai!

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:25.420
Wow! Hiwatari's been blown
away by Dragoon's tornado,

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.460
and fell into the stadium!

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:30.020
Their Beys aren't the
only ones fighting!

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:33.540
Hiwatari gets right
back on his feet!

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:36.850
But where's
Kinomiya's Dragoon?

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.220
Right here!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:50.650
That's...

00:16:50.650 --> 00:16:53.110
F-Sangre's attack this time!

00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:10.060
Takao hasn't forgotten the
techniques he's seen up to now!

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:14.930
He's making them his own.

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:17.890
That's what makes
Takao Kinomiya so strong.

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:20.010
In comparison, Kai...

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:23.800
He's just attacking
head-on with brute strength.

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:27.010
He's going to run
out of moves eventually!

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:28.100
Kai...

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:39.900
If these attacks keep up,
Kai won't be able to beat Takao!

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:42.260
Is that really true?

00:17:43.420 --> 00:17:48.000
Kai should know that's
Takao's specialty.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:52.120
In spite of that, Kai's relying
on his own strength.

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:55.840
He isn't giving up on
his direct attacks.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:59.340
There's a strange sense
of fear about it.

00:17:59.340 --> 00:18:00.580
Rei...

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:02.770
I understand now.

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:06.020
Why Kai chose to
go to Neo-Borg.

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:09.600
And his determination
to win this match.

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:15.740
The Kai we're seeing now isn't
the Kai we've always known!

00:18:16.620 --> 00:18:19.920
Go! Dragoon Galaxy Turbo!

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:27.370
Takao Kinomiya! Right...
You were always like this.

00:18:29.330 --> 00:18:32.170
Ever since
I first lost to you...

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:37.380
I lived my life by trying
to catch up to you.

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:52.100
Sometimes you'd win.

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:53.940
Sometimes you'd lose.

00:18:54.210 --> 00:18:58.370
Battling in
that repeating cycle...

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:01.360
You used the frustration of
defeat as a springboard.

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:04.620
You made your battles with your friends into your own!

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:09.520
Before I realized it...
You were always one step ahead.

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:15.130
So in order you beat you...

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:18.000
My only choice...

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:21.700
Was to trust in
my own strength!

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:32.440
Why did I choose to train in the extreme cold of Russia, which weakened Dranzer's flames?

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:37.760
Why did I choose a partner I
wasn't friendly with, like Yuriy?

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:46.050
It was all to push myself to the extreme for this one moment!

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:49.810
I abandoned everything.

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:54.280
And obsessed over
my Beyblade practice.

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:57.500
To trust in myself!

00:19:57.740 --> 00:20:01.050
To train myself
to the extreme!

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:04.050
And now...

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:28.610
Any wall can be surpassed!
No matter how tall it is!

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:30.540
Here I come, Kinomiya!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:36.720
Here it comes!

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.060
The pressure!

00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:40.370
Takao!

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:42.010
Watch out, Takao!

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:44.010
He's trying to end this!

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:44.840
Takao!

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.160
You better not lose, Takao!

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:50.180
You really are somethin', Kai!

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:54.900
My spirit's been shaking in
anticipation of your power!!

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:56.290
So bring it!

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:02.960
I'll take on your attack!
For Daichi, Rei and Max!

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:10.520
This is Takao Kinomiya at 200% after
surviving the world championships!

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:11.820
It's on!

00:21:11.820 --> 00:21:16.120
I'll show you the real power
of Dranzer Gigus Turbo!

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:19.000
The likes of which
you've never seen!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:21.280
Turbo Engine, full power!!

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:24.890
Go, Dranzer!!

00:22:56.250 --> 00:22:58.020
I can feel it, Kai.

00:22:58.020 --> 00:23:01.730
I can feel your passion
in every attack!

00:23:01.730 --> 00:23:04.880
From here on out it's
just you and me.

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:07.570
Let's fight it out!

00:23:07.570 --> 00:23:11.730
Let's ignore everything else and
hit each other with all we've got!

00:23:11.730 --> 00:23:17.440
Yeah! This isn't the end of our battle!
Not as long as my Beyspirit is burning bright!

00:23:17.440 --> 00:23:22.330
Here I come, Kai! Let me show
you my awesome Beyspirit!
